%description:

Tests that Ieee8021adPolicy rejects an access port without its VLAN id in its
ports parameter at initialization, naming the interface. The network is the one
of lib/ieee8021ad-access-trunk.ini, with one malformed parameter.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini

[General]
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib
*.bridge1.bridging.vlanPolicy.ports = {"eth0" : {"type" : "access"}, "eth1" : {"type" : "access", "vid" : 10}, "eth2" : {"type" : "access", "vid" : 20}, "eth3" : {"type" : "trunk", "vids" : [10, 20]}}
include ../../lib/ieee8021ad-access-trunk.ini

%exitcode: 1
%postrun-command: grep '<!>' test.out test.err > vlan-port-error.out || true
%contains: vlan-port-error.out
The ports entry for interface 'eth0' has no 'vid': a port of type 'access' needs one
